          "title": "We're launching our Somebody app next week.",
          "request": "We're launching our Somebody app next week. Build me a launch-week social media plan for TikTok, Instagram, Facebook and X. Use our company context and public research for the launch context, platform mechanics and publicly observable trends. For the final channel priorities, content formats and messaging recommendations, also use a comparative cross-platform audience-behaviour and engagement benchmark that is not currently available in our company-controlled resources. For this Testnet demonstration, a controlled synthetic external research benchmark is acceptable, but it must be clearly labelled as synthetic/test-provider evidence and must not be represented as live platform analytics. Generic public articles alone do not satisfy that benchmark. If external evidence is needed, use the normal approval flow before finalizing. Deliver a concise founder-ready plan with evidence, recommendations, launch-week cadence and material limitations.",
